 16	// TestIncrementalHistoryMatchesFullRebuild protects the optimization boundary
 17	// between the short-term overlay and the consolidated history projection. The
 18	// overlay is allowed to change how records are found, but its effective truth
 19	// and the user-visible conversation order/provenance must be the same as a
 20	// subsequent full rebuild over the identical transcripts.
