    10	// fakeFusionEmbedder is a deterministic embedder that opts into the history
    11	// fusion gate (unlike fakePlainEmbedder, which models the bundled Model2Vec:
    12	// no marker, gated out). Vectors are assigned per text; unknown text embeds
