     9	// TestHistorySemanticCalibration probes whether the embedder can separate
    10	// relevant history decisions from noise — the gate for adding a semantic arm to
    11	// history (today BM25-only). Model2Vec couldn't: on the live brain an unrelated
    12	// query ("fake metadata") scored cosine 0.336, higher than every paraphrase
    13	// positive (≤0.284). This re-runs the same probe with whatever embedder is
    14	// selected (ENTIRE_BRAIN_EMBEDDER=ollama for EmbeddingGemma) and reports the
    15	// separation: a semantic arm is viable only if the positives' cosine clears the
    16	// negatives'. Env: CALIB_BRAIN, CALIB_BRANCH (main).
    17	func TestHistorySemanticCalibration(t *testing.T) {
